# Go
bin/
*.test
coverage.out

# Env
.env
.env.*

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Admin UI build output.
# internal/app/adminui/dist/index.html stays tracked as a placeholder so that
# go:embed always finds the directory; the real bundle is produced by
# `npm --prefix web/admin run build` before the Go build.
internal/app/adminui/dist/assets/

# Spec and ticket notes written by the issue-tracker workflow described in
# docs/agents/issue-tracker.md. They quote local paths, audit notes and the
# results of local verification runs, so they belong to the machine that wrote
# them and are not published with the repository.
.scratch/

# Agent instructions, the domain glossary and the design records written while
# implementing a feature. They are working material for the machine that wrote
# them rather than part of the gateway, so they stay local too.
#
# Documents that the repository already tracks are not affected by these
# entries: an ignore rule only stops untracked files here from being added.
AGENTS.md
GLOSSARY.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/

# Vitest cache
.vite/

# Package installs
node_modules/
